    "reference": "file:ECOLI/manZ/manZ-deep-research-falcon.md",
    "supporting_text": "**ManY (EIICMan)** and **ManZ (EIIDMan)**: inner-membrane components forming a tight complex; the **IIC/IID subcomplex** is sufficient for **phage DNA penetration** across the inner membrane.",
    "source": "genes/ECOLI/manZ/manZ-deep-research-falcon.md",
